---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Methodologie TriAxis — IA BIAIS INITIATIVE"
  description="La taxonomie TriAxis classe chaque biais de l'IA selon 3 axes orthogonaux : Origine, Lifecycle, Specifique."
>
  <!-- ═══ HERO ═══ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ibi-night text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20" style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #2D46F5 0%, transparent 70%)"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-6">
          Methodologie · Taxonomie
        </p>
        
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-6">
          La taxonomie <span class="text-gradient-ibi">TriAxis</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Chaque biais est classe selon 3 axes orthogonaux qui repondent a 3 questions simples : d'ou vient le biais, a quelle etape survient-il, et quelle est sa nature precise.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#axes" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold rounded-lg gradient-ibi text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
            Explorer les 3 axes
            <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/biais" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold rounded-lg border border-ibi-border text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors">
            Voir les 250 biais
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ POURQUOI TRIAXIS ═══ -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Pourquoi TriAxis</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Une classification qui resiste au temps</h2>
      <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        La plupart des taxonomies existantes classent les biais par <strong class="text-ibi-fg">symptome</strong> (ce que le biais fait) ou par <strong class="text-ibi-fg">domaine</strong> (sante, justice, recrutement...). Ces approches sont utiles mais elles vieillissent mal : de nouveaux biais apparaissent en permanence dans de nouveaux contextes.
      </p>
      <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">
        TriAxis adopte une approche <strong class="text-ibi-fg">structurelle</strong> : elle decrit chaque biais par 3 proprietes fondamentales qui ne dependent ni du domaine, ni de la technologie. Un biais reste classable de la meme maniere qu'il soit detecte en 2020 ou en 2035.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-xl mb-4">O</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Origine</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">
          D'ou vient le biais ? 3 possibilites : systemique, computationnel, ou humain-cognitif.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-xl mb-4">L</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Lifecycle</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">
          A quelle etape du cycle de vie IA ? 6 etapes de L1 (historique) a L6 (deploiement).
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-xl mb-4">S</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Specifique</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">
          Quelle est la nature precise ? 28 categories de S01 (proxy) a S28 (interaction).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ LES 3 AXES EN DETAIL ═══ -->
  <section id="axes" class="bg-ibi-arctic py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Les 3 axes</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Detail des axes O, L et S</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- AXE O -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-2xl">O</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">Axe Origine</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3">D'ou vient le biais ?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">O1</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Systemique</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Le biais est inscrit dans les structures sociales, historiques ou institutionnelles. Il precede l'IA et se reflete dans ses donnees.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">O2</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Computationnel</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Le biais nait de l'algorithme lui-meme : choix de modele, optimisation, representation des donnees, feedbacks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">O3</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Humain-cognitif</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Le biais vient des biais cognitifs des concepteurs, annotateurs ou utilisateurs : ancrage, confirmation, disponibilite.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AXE L -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-2xl">L</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">Axe Lifecycle</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3">A quelle etape du cycle de vie IA ?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L1</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Historique</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Donnees historiques, archives, corpus anciens qui portent les traces du passe.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L2</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Representation</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Choix des variables, encodages, tokenisation, vecteurs de representation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L3</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Mesure</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Metriques, seuils, labels. Ce que l'on mesure determine ce que le modele apprend.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L4</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Agregation</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Fusion de sources, ponderations, moyennes qui effacent des disparites.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L5</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Evaluation</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Choix des jeux de test, metriques de performance, seuils d'acceptation.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
            <div class="text-xs font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary mb-2">L6</div>
            <h4 class="font-display font-semibold mb-3">Deploiement</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed">Mise en production, drift, feedbacks utilisateurs, degradation progressive.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AXE S -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg gradient-ibi flex items-center justify-center text-white font-display font-bold text-2xl">S</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl">Axe Specifique</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg3">Quelle est la nature precise du biais ?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 mb-6">
            28 categories couvrant l'ensemble des mecanismes de biais identifies dans la litterature. Exemples :
          </p>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-sm">
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S01</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Proxy</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S02</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Feedback</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S03</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Selection</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S04</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Sampling</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S05</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Annotation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S07</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Distribution shift</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S10</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Automation</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-ibi-arctic rounded border border-ibi-border">
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-ibi-primary">S24</div>
              <div class="text-ibi-fg2 mt-1">Institutionnel</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 mt-4 italic">
            Liste complete dans la base (28 categories).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ MATRICE & SCORE ═══ -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Systeme de notation</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Le score IBI</h2>
      <p class="text-ibi-fg2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Chaque biais recoit un <strong class="text-ibi-fg">score IBI</strong> (0 a 10) calcule a partir de 4 dimensions quantitatives : severite, frequence, ampleur des groupes impactes et difficulte de detection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">⚠️</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Severite</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">De 1 (mineur) a 5 (critique). Impact potentiel sur les personnes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔁</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Frequence</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Rare, occasionnel, frequent, systematique.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">👥</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Ampleur groupes</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Nombre de groupes proteges impactes (1 a 5).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-6">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🔍</div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mb-2">Detection</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2">Difficulte a identifier le biais (1 = facile, 5 = tres difficile).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-ibi-arctic rounded-xl border border-ibi-border p-8">
      <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-6">Echelle de severite (niveaux officiels)</h3>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-red-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-600 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">5 — Critique</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Risque direct pour les droits fondamentaux. Deploiement a interdire ou restreindre.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-amber-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">4 — Grave</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Discrimination significative identifiee. Correction obligatoire.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-yellow-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">3 — Modere</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Ecart mesurable mais limite. Surveillance et documentation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-green-200">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500 shrink-0"></div>
          <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm w-32">1-2 — Faible</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-ibi-fg2 flex-1">Impact marginal. Amelioration continue.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ EXEMPLE PRATIQUE ═══ -->
  <section class="bg-ibi-night text-white py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-display font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-ibi-primary mb-3">Exemple</p>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">TriAxis en action</h2>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed">
          Voici comment un biais classique est decrit avec TriAxis.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-ibi-marine rounded-2xl border border-ibi-border p-8 md:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 mb-6">
          <span class="font-display font-mono text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded bg-ibi-primary/20 text-ibi-primary">IBI-0002</span>
          <span class="font-display font-mono text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400">Score 9.0</span>
          <span class="font-display font-mono text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">Critique</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-3">Biais de proxy discriminant</h3>
        <p class="text-ibi-fg3 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Variable apparemment neutre servant de substitut statistique a un attribut protege.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Origine</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-white mb-1">O2_computationnel</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3">Nait de l'algorithme et du choix des variables.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Lifecycle</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-white mb-1">L3_mesure</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3">Se manifeste dans le choix des metriques.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-black/30 rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Specifique</div>
            <div class="font-display font-semibold text-white mb-1">S01_proxy</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ibi-fg3">Substitution par variable correlee.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ CTA FINAL ═══ -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="gradient-ibi rounded-2xl p-12 text-center text-white">
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4">Explorer la base</h2>
      <p class="text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        250 biais, 68 reglementations, 21 vues analytiques. Tout est consultable, citable et ouvert.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/biais" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold rounded-lg bg-white text-ibi-primary hover:bg-white/95 transition-colors">
          Voir les 250 biais
        </a>
        <a href="/api" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 font-display font-semibold rounded-lg border-2 border-white/30 text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Documentation API
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
